==Battleground==
*1 [[Casaurian Ahirujo]] spawns as the boss after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*1 [[Camelle]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*8 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*6 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 30~36.67 seconds<sup>900f~1,100f</sup>.
*2 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn after 146.67 seconds<sup>4,400f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Since Casaurian Ahirujo is a [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] enemy, [[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Roe Cat]] can be very helpful here as a tanker. Don't expect most non-[[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber]] anti-Red crowd-controllers to be of use, as most of them get outranged and thus die without doing anything.

